    "description": {
      "value": "This length of silver chain has a tiger's fang on one end and the tip of a dire boar's tusk on the other. When you activate the chain, an ephemeral chain encircles the target creature's head and a cacophony of animal sounds clouds its mind. It must attempt a DC 35 Will save. {'Critical Success': 'The creature is unaffected.', 'Success': 'The creature is confused on its next action.', 'Failure': 'The creature is confused for 1 round.', 'Critical Failure': \"The creature is confused for 1 minute and the creature doesn't receive a flat check to end its confusion if it takes damage. At the end of each of its turns, it attempts a new Will save, ending the effect on a success.\"}"
